{"id":2227,"date":"2021-03-08T14:48:44","date_gmt":"2021-03-08T14:48:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?post_type=person&#038;p=2227"},"modified":"2025-11-01T14:34:44","modified_gmt":"2025-11-01T14:34:44","slug":"sethlina-ocloo-2","status":"publish","type":"person","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/person\/sethlina-ocloo-2\/","title":{"rendered":"Sethlina Ocloo"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover profile-banner bg-alt\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:none\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n\n\n<a href=\"javascript:history.back()\"> <div class=\"profiles-btn\"> \n\n<div class=\"btn-left-sq bg-primary\"> <i class=\"fa fa-caret-left white-text\"> <\/i> <\/div>\n<div class=\"btn-text title-bold white-text\">Back to Profiles<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/a>\n\n<h2 class=\"profile-name\">Sethlina Ocloo<\/h2>\n\n<ul class=\"profile-list prof-pos\" style=\"list-style:none;\"><li class=\"profile-position\">Procurement &amp; Logistics Officer <\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p class=\"profile-info profile-tagline primary-bold prof-pos\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 profile-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Sethlina_IMG_7976-1s.jpg\"\/>\n\n\n<p>Sethlina is a highly organized administrative and procurement professional with eight years of experience, including over six years supporting STEM education initiatives. At AIMS, she has played a central role in coordinating logistics for conferences, workshops, and academic programs that promote mathematics and science among high school and postgraduate students. Her work has been instrumental in delivering impactful STEM events involving both local and international participants. Sethlina manages all aspects of logistical planning, travel, accommodation, vendor contracts, catering, and health services, ensuring smooth and efficient execution. With a BSc. in Human Resource Management and an MSc. in Procurement and Supply Chain Management, she combines strategic coordination with a passion for advancing STEM&nbsp;engagement.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Sethlina is a highly organized administrative and procurement professional with eight years of experience, including over six years supporting STEM education initiatives. At AIMS, she has played a central role in coordinating logistics for conferences, workshops, and academic programs that promote mathematics and science among high school and postgraduate students. Her work has been instrumental<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":13128,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":"","profile-name":"Sethlina Ocloo","profile-position":"Procurement & Logistics Officer ","profile-tagline":""},"tags":[],"people_types":[12],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Sethlina_IMG_7976-1s.jpg","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/adel\/","display_name":"adel"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 5 years ago","modified":"Updated 3 weeks ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on March 8, 2021","modified":"Updated on November 1, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on March 8, 2021 2:48 pm","modified":"Updated on November 1, 2025 2:34 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linked":[],"unlinked":[],"slug":"post_tag","name":"Tags"},"people_types":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/person_type\/management\/\" class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Management<\/a>"],"unlinked":["<span class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Management<\/span>"],"slug":"people_types","name":"Person Type"}},"series_order":"","